Recorded model responses live here, one JSON file per (node, prompt version, prompt) key.

Committed empty, with this file, because git cannot store an empty directory and
tests/test_scaffold.py requires the directory to exist -- without it a fresh clone fails
`make test` before it fails anything interesting. evals/candidates/ is kept the same way.

Empty today, which is why `make eval-replay` cannot run: there is nothing to replay. Record a
set with `MLR_LLM_BACKEND=anthropic make eval` plus --record, and scrub anything key-shaped
before committing (platform_core/llm.py does that on write).
